WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.770 --> 00:00:04.720
"Shang-Chi and the Legend of the Ten Rings"
is another great trip to the Marvel theme

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:05.720
park.

00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:09.549
It's an exciting story full of action and
adventure, but it's more immediately the story

00:00:09.549 --> 00:00:14.360
of Shang-Chi coming to terms with his upbringing,
reconciling the good with the bad, and truly

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:17.040
learning to harness the heart of the dragon.

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:22.440
It's also the story of how martial arts, dragons,
and Tony Leung are cool as hell.

00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:25.980
There is a lot that happens in this movie
towards the end — a lot of action, a lot

00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:29.080
of overlapping set pieces, and a lot of cool
monsters.

00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:33.300
So we'll try to break down the ending of the
movie, both a blow-by-blow of the action and

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:34.550
some of the themes.

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:38.470
We're also going to talk about how each of
the three main characters have their own hero's

00:00:38.470 --> 00:00:39.470
journey.

00:00:39.470 --> 00:00:42.630
Let's begin by talking about Wenwu's arrival
at Ta-Lo.

00:00:42.630 --> 00:00:47.630
The citizens of Ta-Lo try to convince Wenwu
one last time that his wife isn't behind the

00:00:47.630 --> 00:00:49.940
dark gate, but to no avail.

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:52.790
Wenwu and the Ten Rings start a battle against
Ta-Lo.

00:00:52.790 --> 00:00:57.790
Katy is repeatedly denied the chance to join
the fight, being told that she's not ready.

00:00:57.790 --> 00:00:58.920
"Oh.

00:00:58.920 --> 00:01:00.070
Right."

00:01:00.070 --> 00:01:04.619
Wenwu and Shang-Chi finally have a showdown,
during which the father defeats the son and

00:01:04.619 --> 00:01:06.509
throws him into the water.

00:01:06.509 --> 00:01:11.409
Wenwu makes it to the gate and begins attacking
it, freeing what are referred to as "soulsuckers."

00:01:11.409 --> 00:01:16.070
These small, freaky flying creatures start
attacking the village, stealing the souls

00:01:16.070 --> 00:01:20.500
of both Ta-Lo citizens and the Ten Rings,
including Death Dealer.

00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:25.040
The two sides agree to a truce, and begin
fighting the soulsuckers together.

00:01:25.040 --> 00:01:29.399
As Shang-Chi sinks further and further into
the depths underwater, The Great Protector

00:01:29.399 --> 00:01:33.799
— likely sensing that Shang-Chi has the
heart of the dragon — awakens.

00:01:33.799 --> 00:01:37.090
Shang-Chi comes bursting out of the water
on the back of The Great Protector, with the

00:01:37.090 --> 00:01:40.200
dragon eating many of the soulsuckers.

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:44.039
Shang-Chi is dropped off to fight his father,
during which Shang-Chi finally harnesses the

00:01:44.039 --> 00:01:45.469
power of the elements.

00:01:45.469 --> 00:01:49.380
At this point, though, it's too late: the
soulsuckers have acquired enough souls to

00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:55.310
free the so-called Dweller-in-Darkness, an
enormous lizard/dragon/alien who may or may

00:01:55.310 --> 00:01:58.130
not be based on the comic character Fin Fang
Foom.

00:01:58.130 --> 00:02:03.270
The Dweller grabs Wenwu and devours him, with
Wewnu expressing regret as the Rings transfer

00:02:03.270 --> 00:02:05.049
to Shang-Chi.

00:02:05.049 --> 00:02:08.649
Shang-Chi rides on the Great Protector, who
takes on the Dweller-in-Darkness.

00:02:08.649 --> 00:02:13.640
At one point, Xialing joins Shang-Chi, almost
falling off the Great Protector and telling

00:02:13.640 --> 00:02:15.500
Shang-Chi to let her go.

00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:19.590
The moment reflects an earlier time in their
lives when Xialing was left behind by her

00:02:19.590 --> 00:02:20.590
brother.

00:02:20.590 --> 00:02:24.620
This time, however, Shang-Chi says no, he's
not going to lose her again.

00:02:24.620 --> 00:02:28.620
At this point, many people have been lost
and the situation has become dire — until

00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:31.280
Katy is finally allowed to join the fight.

00:02:31.280 --> 00:02:35.290
The Dweller tries to absorb the power of the
dragon, but Katy manages to shoot the Dweller

00:02:35.290 --> 00:02:37.540
in the neck with an enhanced arrow.

00:02:37.540 --> 00:02:41.420
The beast is finally defeated, and the village
mourns those they lost.

00:02:41.420 --> 00:02:45.530
Back in San Francisco, Shang-Chi and Katy
recount their adventure to friends, adding

00:02:45.530 --> 00:02:49.680
that Xialing went to her father's compound
to shut down the operation.

00:02:49.680 --> 00:02:54.230
These friends, understandably, don't believe
them ... until Wong shows up, makes sure Shang-Chi

00:02:54.230 --> 00:02:57.260
has the Rings, and brings them back through
a portal.

00:02:57.260 --> 00:03:01.510
The mid-credits scene reveals that the Rings
were a beacon, and Bruce Banner and Carol

00:03:01.510 --> 00:03:04.350
Danvers welcome the two to "the circus."

00:03:04.350 --> 00:03:08.870
Instead of going back home, Katy and Shang-Chi
take Wong out for some karaoke, with all three

00:03:08.870 --> 00:03:11.690
belting out a celebratory "Hotel California."

00:03:11.690 --> 00:03:16.480
The post-credits scene reveals that Xialing
did not, in fact, shut down the operation.

00:03:16.480 --> 00:03:20.270
Instead, she took it over and now seems to
be training an army.

00:03:20.270 --> 00:03:24.510
Her designs at this point are unknown, but
fans are told by a title card that the Ten

00:03:24.510 --> 00:03:26.620
Rings will return.

00:03:26.620 --> 00:03:29.350
Shang-Chi's transformation is both complex
and simple.

00:03:29.350 --> 00:03:33.850
He started the movie as a man trying to move
on from his upbringing, but nobody — especially

00:03:33.850 --> 00:03:37.600
people with literal supervillain fathers — can
outrun their past.

00:03:37.600 --> 00:03:41.900
By the end of the movie, he has stopped running
and come to terms with his upbringing: the

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:44.120
good, the bad, the ugly, and the beautiful.

00:03:44.120 --> 00:03:47.220
He has the heart of the dragon, like his mother
said.

00:03:47.220 --> 00:03:51.710
It's not 100% clear whether his father willingly
gave him the Rings or whether he retrieved

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:56.540
them himself, but either way the end result
is that he is worthy to wield them.

00:03:56.540 --> 00:04:01.160
When Katy trained as an archer, she was told
that she'd hit nothing if she aimed at nothing.

00:04:01.160 --> 00:04:04.120
At the start of the movie, Katy is proudly
directionless.

00:04:04.120 --> 00:04:08.770
She revels in being good enough at a dead
end job that allows her to party all the time.

00:04:08.770 --> 00:04:12.840
Now she has a purpose — however, she still
makes time for late night karaoke.

00:04:12.840 --> 00:04:16.070
Xialing, meanwhile, had to learn her skills
in the shadows.

00:04:16.070 --> 00:04:19.279
Her father would barely acknowledge her, much
less train her.

00:04:19.279 --> 00:04:23.150
She also learned not to trust people, especially
the men in her life.

00:04:23.150 --> 00:04:27.279
It's too early to tell whether she trusts
Shang-Chi again, but now that she's in charge

00:04:27.279 --> 00:04:31.569
of something more powerful than an underground
fighting ring, it's clear that she'll never

00:04:31.569 --> 00:04:34.550
let women be sidelined again under her watch.

00:04:34.550 --> 00:04:36.250
"You're like such a badass.

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:38.009
Everything you do is so cool."

